/* bench 8827.2.5 430354d8f9ff */
/* bench 8827.2.6 ccebe460ff1f */
/* bench 8827.2.7 b532f36a2b42 */
          mode. The RK3288 PMU is dedicated for managing the power of the whole chip.

          If unsure, say N.

